  m_Name: IntroPage_06
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroPageData
  pageTitle: Bob's Reason
  pageBody: 'Bob was one of them.


    He did not enter the Junkyards to save the
    world. He did not care about glory, history, or humanity''s future.


    He
    just needed money.


    Because the father of the girl he loved once told him:


    "Buy
    a house in the city first. Then we can talk about marriage."


    And so, Bob
    stepped onto a road that few Garbage Men ever returned from.'
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cadbfd211d4333b409ad52d361ca3eca, type: 3}
